# SPDX-License-Identifier: LicenseRef-CSSL-1.0

a program to interact with an USIM simcard via a pl2303-based
USB simcard reader (tested with usb device 067b:2303 as sold by
Laurent Thomas' Open Cells company)

Once running, any program connects to it with TCP and sends command to
retrieve the IMSI and do AUTHENTICATE challenges with the USIM simcard.

todo: support CCID/ICCD readers (through PC/SC instead of pl2303)
